This one isn't an ARexx nor MCI trick either, just a very small
mini-tutorial on MCI color codes.

It explains a little bit about the MCI color codes and a couple of the
effects (reverse, blinking, background) codes.  You can put this one
wherever you want, GFiles, a bulletins menu (like SN Bulletins --
shameless plug :) or in SysText:Help/...  Who knows.
